ough so I don't pay twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0174hhvfJemDRn7NJmcaXE6J", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01SZpgPstAn2xiA6DsXohvy5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Harbor Logistics"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The wire went through, but the invoice still shows \"approved.\" I'll link the payment to the invoice so it's marked paid, without sending the money again.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NGw2t7pXm1ScTSBGoQNNgw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"payment_id": "PAY0001", "invoice_id": "INV-34721"}, "name": "link_payment", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Harbor Logistics's approved invoice in full by wire, and it was paid only once.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-34721, $4,676.43, due 2026-11-04\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, a wire from the operating account for $4,676.43, status \"sent\"\n- **Approval:** At $4,676.43 it's under the $10,000 limit, so it didn't need the controller's approval.\n\nThe wire request timed out, so before retrying I checked the payment list. It showed the wire had actually gone through as PAY0001. The invoice was still showing \"approved,\" though, so I linked PAY0001 to it, and the invoice is now marked paid. I didn't retry the wire or use ACH, so there's no duplicate payment.\n\nI didn't touch Harbor Logistics's other two invoices: INV-10769 ($3,536.78) was already paid, and INV-73032 ($8,941.78) is a draft that's still awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}